{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120875","id":3981992792,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7tWGNY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120875","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120875.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120875.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120875","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120875/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120875/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120875/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/93f351bf6d1a58aff290309f4f2151f8826452bc","number":120875,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[.NET] Add support for web export using static LibGodot","user":{"login":"spirit122","id":67442190,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDQyMTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67442190?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122","html_url":"https://github.com/spirit122","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is an updated continuation of #118976, based on `NoctemCat:libgodot_mono_web`.\r\n\r\nThe original implementation commits and authorship are preserved. This branch adds:\r\n\r\n- A merge of current `godotengine/master`, resolving the one conflict in `platform/web/export/export_plugin.cpp` by keeping the newer `p_notify`/`ExportNotifier` signature.\r\n- A small cleanup for Python pre-3.12 compatibility in `platform_methods.py` (`delete_on_close=False` -> `delete=False`).\r\n- A typo fix in `Browser.targets`.\r\n- Documentation for the Web .NET / LibGodot template build flags.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\nEnvironment:\r\n\r\n- Windows 11\r\n- Emscripten 3.1.56 from local emsdk\r\n- Python 3.14 / SCons 4.10.1\r\n- .NET SDKs 9.0.310 and 10.0.100 installed\r\n\r\nNon-threaded Web .NET template:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nscons platform=web target=template_debug module_mono_enabled=yes arch=wasm32 \\\r\n    library_type=static_library threads=no lto=none disable_crash_handler=yes -j8\r\n```\r\n\r\nProduced:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nbin/godot.web.template_debug.wasm32.nothreads.mono.zip   42,989,789 bytes\r\nbin/libgodot.web.template_debug.wasm32.nothreads.a       176,889,360 bytes\r\n```\r\n\r\nThreaded Web .NET template:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nscons platform=web target=template_debug module_mono_enabled=yes arch=wasm32 \\\r\n    library_type=static_library threads=yes proxy_to_pthread=yes lto=none \\\r\n    disable_crash_handler=yes -j8\r\n```\r\n\r\nProduced:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nbin/godot.web.template_debug.wasm32.mono.zip   43,025,654 bytes\r\nbin/libgodot.web.template_debug.wasm32.a       176,676,002 bytes\r\n```\r\n\r\nBoth zips contain the expected LibGodot payload:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nlibgodot/libgodot.a\r\nlibgodot/config.json\r\nlibgodot/js_library/*.js\r\nlibgodot/pre_js/callMain_stub.js\r\nlibgodot/post_js/patch_em_gl.js\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Disclosure\r\n\r\nThis PR was prepared with AI assistance. The branch is based on #118976, and the original implementation authorship is preserved in the commit history. The merge resolution, cleanup, docs, and local build validation were performed in this checkout.\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-02T23:09:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T10:54:05Z","closed_at":"2026-07-02T23:44:36Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9f09e688c8a31b4b3945663ded71507eea7f58ed","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"spirit122:codex/libgodot-mono-web-successor","ref":"codex/libgodot-mono-web-successor","repo":{"id":1287646909,"node_id":"R_kgDOTL_uvQ","name":"godot","full_name":"spirit122/godot","owner":{"login":"spirit122","id":67442190,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDQyMTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67442190?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122","html_url":"https://github.com/spirit122","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Godot Engine – Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine","homepage":"https://godotengine.org","language":null,"visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"for